        "text_XAY4VQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Copper Bottle</h3><p>Our 1-litre pure copper bottles make a refined corporate gift, combining everyday utility with the natural character of copper and the distinctive design language of &nbsp;<strong>Social India Craft</strong>.</p><h3>Copper Bottles with Handcrafted Covers</h3><p>A beautiful meeting of <strong>traditional craft and contemporary gifting</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>Our 1-litre pure copper bottles are paired with handcrafted crochet covers, creating a gift that is <strong>useful, distinctive and unmistakably Indian</strong>. Thoughtfully designed for festive celebrations, employee appreciation, client gifting and special occasions.</p><h3>Copper Bottles with Ganesh & Diya Holders</h3><p></p><p>A meaningful expression of <strong>Indian tradition, craftsmanship and festive spirit</strong>.</p><p>Our pure copper bottles are paired with handcrafted <strong>Ganesh and Diya crochet holders</strong>, bringing together utility and the warmth of Indian celebrations. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; A thoughtful choice for&nbsp;</p><p><strong>festive gifting, client appreciation and meaningful corporate occasions</strong>.</p>",
            "text_size": "subheading"
          }
        }
